y, Alex is seen exploring the Niagara falls by helicopter, the a tunnel that takes him to the observation desk and then by ferry. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003031216 +0200" stop="20251003034210 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">Boarding Pass  [S01 : E04 Boarding Pass Bronnoysund, Norway]</title><desc lang="it">The small coastal settlement of Brønnøysund is flanked on one side by an archipelago of islets and on the other by rolling farm country, and Jamie Lowe experiences the best of both worlds during his visit. He goes hiking in Trollfjel Geopark, visits a sea cave and learns about the folklore surrounding the Troll mountains. He also visits a local farmhouse to learn about life in the Norwegian countryside, and goes on to try cod fishing. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003034216 +0200" stop="20251003041210 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">Off The Grid [S01 : E18 Off The Grid Majuli 2, Assam]</title><desc lang="it">From the neo - Vaishnavite cult practices at Satras to the distinct traditions of the Mishing tribes, Majuli is home to many unique cultures. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003041217 +0200" stop="20251003044211 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">10 Days Sri Lanka [S01 : E01 10 Days Sri Lanka Colombo]</title><desc lang="it">Sabrina Bussandri visits the iconic sights of Colombo, and goes on to take a river safari and visit a turtle hatchery in Bentota. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003044218 +0200" stop="20251003051212 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">Xplore Thailand [S01 : E04 Xplore Thailand Phuket]</title><desc lang="it">A traveller lives in the wind that carries him from one end of the world to another. Would you recognize its edge? Welcoming you to Phuket. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003051218 +0200" stop="20251003054212 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">Backpack [S01 : E05 Backpack Kozhikode &amp; Alleppey, India]</title><desc lang="it">Summer Shiels gets a glimpse into the traditions, culture and beliefs of Alleppey during a stay on a houseboat. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003054219 +0200" stop="20251003061213 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">Food Fact Fun [S01 : E05 Food Fact Fun Vancouver, Canada]</title><desc lang="it">Alex starts his Vancouver exploration by visiting Bridges restaurant where he tries smoked salmon pizza with some seafood. Then he visits the Richmond Night Market and then Treasure Cafe. Later visits the Steel Toad Brewery in Olympic Village. Next he explores the Gastown, including the steam clock. Further he explores the Hills Native Art ending with Vancouver observation deck. Next he rides on board the Grouse Mountain Skyride, ending with Capilano Suspension Bridge park. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003061219 +0200" stop="20251003064213 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">Boarding Pass  [S01 : E05 Boarding Pass Roros, Norway]</title><desc lang="it">Røros, a historical Norwegian copper mining town full of impeccable wooden buildings, is a place that makes you travel back in time. Jamie Lowe strolls around the quaint town and checks out the mining museum to learn about the town’s fascinating history. Following this, he goes through Lærdal Tunnel, the world’s longest road tunnel, on his way to Flåm. Upon reaching, he goes to the Flåm Railway Museum, where he gets to know the exciting stories behind building the world's steepest railway. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003064220 +0200" stop="20251003071214 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">Off The Grid [S01 : E17 Off The Grid Bomdila, Arunachal Pradesh]</title><desc lang="it">From a festival of warriors to the zombie - proof houses of people, Alex explores the distinctive traditions of the tribes in Arunachal Pradesh. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003071221 +0200" stop="20251003074215 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">10 Days Sri Lanka [S01 : E02 10 Days Sri Lanka Galle]</title><desc lang="it">Sabrina Bussandri loses herself in the colonial hangover of Galle - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003074222 +0200" stop="20251003081216 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">Boarding Pass  [S01 : E05 Boarding Pass Roros, Norway]</title><desc lang="it">Røros, a historical Norwegian copper mining town full of impeccable wooden buildings, is a place that makes you travel back in time. Jamie Lowe strolls around the quaint town and checks out the mining museum to learn about the town’s fascinating history. Following this, he goes through Lærdal Tunnel, the world’s longest road tunnel, on his way to Flåm. Upon reaching, he goes to the Flåm Railway Museum, where he gets to know the exciting stories behind building the world's steepest railway. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003081223 +0200" stop="20251003084217 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">Backpack [S01 : E11 Backpack Kochi, India]</title><desc lang="it">Sommer recalls her experience of her stay on houseboat. Watch as she learns about Malayalee food culture. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003084223 +0200" stop="20251003091217 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">Food Fact Fun [S01 : E06 Food Fact Fun Vancouver Island, Canada]</title><desc lang="it">Alex is in Vancouver Island and calls for Saffron salmon at Modern Cafe. Next he visits “Red fish blue fish” a fish and chip shop and tries freshly prepared seafood. Further explores the Parksville beach for its sand sculptures and then explores a 50 year old Symphony Winery. Further Alex visits “Eagle wing whale watching” for fun and knowledge about the ocean life. To add to the adventure rush he tries motocross and then snorkels in cold waters of Nanaimo. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003091224 +0200" stop="20251003094218 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">Boarding Pass  [S01 : E06 Boarding Pass Flam, Norway]</title><desc lang="it">Flåm is an idyllic town sitting in a spectacular setting at the head of Aurlandsfjorden. Here, Jamie Lowe takes a train ride filled with breathtaking views along Flåmsbana, the world’s steepest railway line. He also takes a cruise to see the stunning UNESCO - listed fjord, Nærøyfjord, and goes on to experience the cuisine and ways of life of the Vikings in Njardarheimr, a Viking village in nearby Gudvangen. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003094225 +0200" stop="20251003101219 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">Off The Grid [S01 : E16 Off The Grid Tawang, Arunachal Pradesh]</title><desc lang="it">From the traditions practiced at a monastery to the simple meals eaten by farmers, Alex experiences Tawang’s harmonious ways of life. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003101226 +0200" stop="20251003104220 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">10 Days Sri Lanka [S01 : E03 10 Days Sri Lanka Merissa]</title><desc lang="it">Sabrina Bussandri tries whale watching in Mirissa - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003104226 +0200" stop="20251003111220 +0200" channel="RakutenTravelxpEng.it"><title lang="it">Xplore India [S01 : E02 Xplore India Chattisgarh 2]</title><desc lang="it">As Aradhana’s journey in Chhattisgarh continues, she is stunned to discover the wealth of natural beauty that the state has to offer. - EPG by epg-guide.com</desc></programme><programme start="20251003111226 +0200" stop="20251003114220 +0200" channel="RakutenTrav